[{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>State the asymptotes of each of the following curves:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{16}-\\dfrac{y^2}4=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-9y^2=36\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-2y^2=16\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt4}{\\sqrt{16}}=\\frac24=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\frac12x\\text{ and }y=-\\frac12x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-9y^2=36\\Rightarrow\\frac{x^2}{36}-\\frac{y^2}4=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt4}{\\sqrt{36}}=\\frac29=\\frac13\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac13x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac13x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-2y^2=16\\Rightarrow\\frac{x^2}{16}-\\frac{y^2}8=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt8}{\\sqrt{16}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt2}4=\\frac{\\sqrt2}2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{\\sqrt2}2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\frac{\\sqrt2}2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Sketch each of the following curves, label each intersection with the axes clearly and label any asymptotes in your sketch.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}9-\\dfrac{y^2}{25}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}2-\\dfrac{y^2}5=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-5y^2=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}-\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&gt;b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}-\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a&lt;b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}-\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\sqrt{25}}{\\sqrt9}=\\frac53\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so asymptotes <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\pm\\frac53x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\pm3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/solutions/assets/diagrams/123-p1-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 