ss=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\pm\\frac bax\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\pm a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/solutions/assets/diagrams/123-p3-2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac ba\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so asymptotes <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\pm\\frac bax\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\pm a\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/solutions/assets/diagrams/123-p4-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>For constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, each of the curves below are of the form</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>In each case find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/questions/assets/diagrams/123-q3a.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/questions/assets/diagrams/123-q3b.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li><li><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/questions/assets/diagrams/123-q3c.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac ba=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=3\\text{ and }b=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac ba=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=2\\text{ and }b=4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac ba=\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=\\sqrt7\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=\\sqrt7\\text{ and }b=\\sqrt{21}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>For a constant <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, a hyperbola is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{2a^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write down the equations of the asymptotes of the curve.</p></li><li><p>Hence, sketch the curve,</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\pm\\frac{2a^2}{a^2}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Asymptotes are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\sqrt2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-\\sqrt2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/solutions/assets/diagrams/123-p5-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>For constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, a hyperbola is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>It passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(-3,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(6,\\sqrt6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Hence, sketch the curve.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3,0)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac9{a^2}=1\\text{ so }a=\\pm3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(6,\\sqrt6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{36}9-\\frac6{b^2}=1\\text{ so }b=\\pm\\sqrt2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}9-\\frac{y^2}2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/solutions/assets/diagrams/123-p5-2.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>For constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, a hyperbola is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}{a^2}-\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>It passes through <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"P(2,-\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Q(-3,3\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Hence, sketch the curve.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2,-\\sqrt3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac4{a^2}-\\frac3{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>At <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3,3\\sqrt2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac9{a^2}-\\frac{18}{b^2}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So that</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{24}{a^2}-\\frac{18}{b^2}=6\\Rightarrow\\frac{24}{a^2}+(1-\\frac9{a^2})=6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\Rightarrow\\frac{15}{a^2}=5\\Rightarrow a^2=3\\quad\\therefore a=\\pm\\sqrt3\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac43-\\frac3{b^2}=1\\Rightarrow b^2=9\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore a=\\pm\\sqrt3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=\\pm3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{x^2}3-\\frac{y^2}9=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/solutions/assets/diagrams/123-p6-1.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.23-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Find the equation of the curve below in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2-py^2=q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants to be found.</p><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/1.23/questions/assets/diagrams/123-q7.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>","steps":["<p>Assume curve of the form:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{y^2}b-\\frac{x^2}a=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let the asymptote be:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac ab=\\frac12\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>From the intercepts: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{y^2}4-\\frac{x^2}{16}=1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n-4y^2+x^2=-16\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\therefore x^2-4y^2=-16\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]